4. Write a simple phishing email template targeting users of a popular app (for example, 'Your Paytm account is suspended, click here to verify'). Highlight the suspicious elements that make it a phishing attempt.<br><br><em><strong>Hint:</strong> Think about fake links, urgent language, or requests for sensitive info.</em>
