[This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.]
Suspicious elements
Why it is suspicious
Urgent deadline:
Attackers often create urgency so users don't think carefully.
"Unusual activity":
Creates fear and encourages the user to act immediately.
Account suspension threat:
Makes the victim worried about losing access.
Unexpected verification request:
Legitimate services generally don't ask users to verify accounts through suspicious email links.
Unknown sender domain:
example-mail.com is not an official Paytm domain
Generic greeting:
"Dear Customer" instead of the user's name

